1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,640
M: Jane, can you spare an hour this afternoon?

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:08,200
I need you to explain some of the figures you put down on the report I got from you last week.

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:11,800
W: I'm terribly sorry, Jack, but could that wait until tomorrow?

4
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:17,240
I have to step out of the office right after lunch to meet with a very important client downtown.

5
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,465
I have a great chance to land a big contract today.

6
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:21,950
M: Oh, is that right?

7
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,990
I really do hope you get it.

8
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:29,400
Anyway, could you do me a favor and drop by my office first thing tomorrow morning?

9
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:34,220
I really need you to explain some of the parts I don't understand in the report.

10
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:35,140
W: Sure thing, Jack.

11
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:37,900
I will be in your office at 9 o'clock sharp.
